g principles.\n\n### Pages\n\nPDF rendered as 12 page image(s); source text is not exposed in the DOM.\n\n- https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/notebooklm/ABzcPv3rJgs4y_riPHPcpJ5xgZzwuoAhSvFhvZqjd7bR0d-v1EwSCnHEaox56RAeTFE74U0OpjJIteYHZrWx4PP7WYGS-D8v5mZVpRBGNxStxO0sb_q-kJhIFVLfIV2NBdo1OirG8Ql3Xg=w839-h1187-v0?authuser=0\n- https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/notebooklm/ABzcPv2KKlB--_tkXX_1_rk5RxegQl8kToTwYmtsyImJkDRk0Xm6LNtiOruU_tHHqdfExp2h4nwCAQE6GVslIfjYoB_pNTPTy2tec969aCF84OT8iia0PHITltbVtQdHqtIFVczdMEQKUw=w838-h1187-v0?authuser=0\n- https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/notebooklm/ABzcPv0oMizyKtTCCppG0pAM1Igj8IzGD21_fhVo-gAhbSfL_TMxttaUXveRY3SFqkYNaFfwZ3iTDo3gMUgVSGvNT4pi6icudmBqEuHX0j8mun36tQ_trldvLT9fI6JflRQ_rqYHW9RSHw=w839-h1187-v0?authuser=0\n- https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/notebooklm/ABzcPv3VuQF8OXKFVOqIaq6LRq3XemaDjEftjkmNml4A9ZHxHHh_b6LH03IhiRtQEsM26q56WkctIDbqzgU_SnAxoUiYlVfTvqz5HqMtRyXWWsDcoQ_rO4rPiOZ9oYIiFAiwveo5FH-V1g=w839-h1187-v0?authuser=0\n- https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/notebooklm/ABzcPv2A_bri2QrBlmBzhHtJ1FGzOBpZaN_mkEcz2xfE73KmR7Z48pTgPZvAk5mZprxOzZsgMlyVmuBjw2aZRHhr_6U4IK85MW_gHKR84aA_oCEwOEdRW2wasbYgBQHMYWjE8bd0jlVo=w839-h1187-v0?authuser=0\n- https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/notebooklm/ABzcPv3I2Jz_GnXg_SEPVs6Hn6vf5D8T4Hs6HFb3RBtlHFZ1Vzveyz__2tMb1w0FCvYPv97qgqK9s0qPO8XXfpA1jUABFEVkZgkPxhUIhKaVBaQ3iRMFsuyAD71W9tY9-cn5qoG6XdTNXA=w839-h1187-v0?authuser=0\n- https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/notebooklm/ABzcPv3mRpde_UeQ0bHYW4hBVuriQa6--A44HeGxkzENLor1zS-bpuniT-tC-PO5IYoghL1otIRE8evtjLORw_zrbI_zmGF1hkhHNJNAI3ksHAWWNx-J4mZA4rYqibfKJqGQIp3DVW5JcQ=w839-h1187-v0?authuser=0\n- https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/notebooklm/ABzcPv2fRJNtvzPQnfH_nnm4UhYp49V_RL86ePacuTrv8lWUKL6RBkx1GjqYvBzwo6kG3qpyl7OPxnMn2tt4VISagf6X2d-lwDyU14s6lEvNXlK5TFUgNHr_PtNE_nN_t4F9Btx5UXGP=w839-h1187-v0?authuser=0\n- https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/notebooklm/ABzcPv0dwZEiqKRduN82OyaoWFihCTVyNy2ZlkjNVi0bl2Y4nG9-gfJq6q6Gu3_0dCiYzeFbWnzT8Gr_LWOa-aasUa1I0oImO3MLuM07pQMpgerlPcat_TBCQzw